    61  *> Changes:
    62  *> 20/09/2025 vbc - 1.0.00 Created - starting. Prior to testing.
    63  *>                         After testing version will be set to v3.3.
    64  *>                         WARNING: You MUST set the terminal program to be 80
    65  *>                          cols wide and MORE than 25 lines deep and this is to
    66  *>                          allow for the some of the extra lines beyond 24 to
    67  *>                          be used as areas for the warning or error messages
    68  *>                          to be displayed. 26 lines is the minimum.
    69  *>                          This procedure must be applied at all times when
    70  *>                          running Payroll.
    71  *>                          For almost all terminal programs, can be achieved
    72  *>                          by pulling the left and bottom edges of the terminal
    73  *>                          screen with the mouse and holding right button and
    74  *>                          pulling until the correct number is displayed, and
    75  *>                          doing so, one at a time or pulling bottom right
    76  *>                          corner.
    77  *> 30/10/2025 vbc -        Still working on file rec layouts (ws) + selects(sel)
    78  *>                         & fd's (fd).
    79  *> 05/11/2025 vbc -        Adding more SS for data input or display and menus.
    80  *>                         Some of which may well go into another program.
    81  *> 21/11/2025 vbc -        Code taken from py900 Account processing ONLY.
    82  *> 23/11/2025 vbc -    .01 Added support for GL for account nos, Testing for
    83  *>                         reset numbers in IRS and GL when building default
    84  *>                         accounts as they may well not exist AND test for
    85  *>                         errors when writing accounts file which will cause an
    86  *>                         abort of this initial creating file functions on first
    87  *>                         using Payroll as a fatal condition.
    88  *>                         Renamed zz section / paragraphs that are normal
    89  *>                         functions into new names starting with ab000 etc
    90  *>                         as very messy.
    91  *>                         WARNING - Absolutely no testing done for GL as I have
    92  *>                         no idea about USA GL CoA's. Might try and reseach
    93  *>                         this at some point when coding completed.
    94  *>                         IN which case these comments will be removed -
    95  *>                         providing I remember.
    96  *> 27/11/2025 vbc -    .02 Screen size now checked for Minimum of 28 lines.
    97  *>                         All other programs wil do the same. Msg SY010 chgd.
    98  *> 09/12/2025 vbc -        Increased minimum screen depth = 28.
    99  *> 24/03/2026 vbc -    .03 Forgot to Read the param file as data is required.
   100  *>
