   447  *>  File Access Control Functions  *
   448  *>                                 *
   449  *>**********************************
   450  *> 28/05/16 vbc - Added RDB setup fields - socket, host, port to user, passwd, schema.
   451  *> 25/08/16 vbc - Amended size of RDBMS-Socket from 32 to 64 chars.
   452  *> 01/10/16 vbc - Changed WE-Error & Rrn to pic 999 / 9.  To see if it is the cause
   453  *>                of No data in SYSTOT-REC bug after running sys4LD.
   454  *> 29/10/16 vbc - FS-Action increased size from 20 to 22 for logest msg in sys002.
   455  *>  7/12/16 vbc - Increased Access-Type to 99 from 9 for extra adhoc functions
   456  *>                such as select x ORDER BY etc.
   457  *>                Not used yet.
   458  *> 22/12/16 vbc - Oops, previous chg should have been for File-Function.
   459  *>                next-read-raw changed to 13.
   460  *> 06/01/17 vbc - Increased size of rrn for GL. System to be recompiled.
   461  *> 18/04/17 vbc - Added function Read-Next-Header (34) for SL020, 50, 140.
   462  *> 21/04/18 vbc - Added ACAS-Path and Path-Work for scr save/dumps delete files).
   463  *> 20/05/23 vbc - Added notes for read header for sl820.
   464  *> 06/08/23 vbc - Activated  fn-not-greater-than (for Stock file).
