  1645   aa000-Main                  section.
  1646  *>**********************************
  1647  *> Force Esc, PgUp, PgDown, PrtSC to be detected
  1648       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_EXCEPTIONS" to "Y".
  1649       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_ESC" to "Y".
  1650       move     current-Date to WSE-Date-block.
