  1652       move     WSE-MM  to  WSD-MM.
  1653       move     WSE-SS  to  WSD-SS.
  1654  *>
  1655       perform  forever
  1656                accept   WS-Env-Lines   from lines
  1657                if       WS-Env-Lines < 28
  1658                         display  SY010    at 0101 with erase eos
  1659                         accept   WS-Reply at 0133
  1660                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
  1661                         exit perform cycle
  1662                end-if
  1663                accept   WS-Env-Columns from Columns
  1664                if       WS-Env-Columns < 80
  1665                         display  SY013    at 0101 with erase eos
  1666                         accept   WS-Reply at 0130
  1667                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
  1668                         exit perform cycle
  1669                end-if
  1670       end-perform.
