  2272   ZZ040-Evaluate-Message      Section.
  2273  *>**********************************
  2274  *>
  2275  *> For PY-PR1 parameter file anfd other using PR-PR1-Status.
  2276  *>
  2277  *>C      copy "FileStat-Msgs-2.cpy" replacing MSG    by WS-Eval-Msg
  2278  *>C                                         STATUS by PY-PR1-Status.
  2279  *> ***************************************************************
  2280  *> ** Author: Gary L. Cutler                                    **
  2281  *> **         CutlerGL@gmail.com                                **
  2282  *> ** Amendments Vincent B. Coen                                **
  2283  *> **         vbcoen@gmail.com                                  **
  2284  *> **                                                           **
  2285  *> ** This copybook defines an EVALUATE statement capable of    **
  2286  *> ** translating two-digit FILE-STATUS codes to a message.     **
  2287  *> **                                                           **
  2288  *> ** Use the REPLACING option to COPY to change the names of   **
  2289  *> ** the MSG and STATUS identifiers to                         **
  2290  *> ** the names your program needs.                             **
  2291  *> Such as replacing STATUS by fs-reply msg by exception-msg.   **
  2292  *>                                                              **
  2293  *> ** chg 09/08/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  2294  *> ** Chg 11/12/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  2295  *> ** Chg 10/04/25 vbc match all quotes & spacing/layout        **
  2296  *> ** chg to FREE format                                        **
  2297  *> ** Chg 24/08/25 vbc #91 description.                         **
  2298  *> ** Chg 15.11.25 vbc Replace all ' for "                      **
  2299  *> ***************************************************************
  2300  *>
  2301   EVALUATE PY-PR1-Status
  2302   WHEN "00" MOVE "Success                  " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2303   WHEN "02" MOVE "Success Duplicate        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2304   WHEN "04" MOVE "Success Incomplete       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2305   WHEN "05" MOVE "Success Optional, Missing" TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2306   when "06" move "Multiple Records LS      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2307   WHEN "07" MOVE "Success No Unit          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2308   when "09" move "Success LS Bad Data      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2309   WHEN "10" MOVE "End Of File              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2310   WHEN "14" MOVE "Out Of Key Range         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2311   WHEN "21" MOVE "Key Invalid              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2312   WHEN "22" MOVE "Key Exists               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2313   WHEN "23" MOVE "Key Not Exists           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2314   WHEN "24" MOVE "Key Boundary violation   " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2315   WHEN "30" MOVE "Permanent Error          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2316   WHEN "31" MOVE "Inconsistent Filename    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2317   WHEN "34" MOVE "Boundary Violation       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2318   WHEN "35" MOVE "File Not Found           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2319   WHEN "37" MOVE "Permission Denied        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2320   WHEN "38" MOVE "Closed With Lock         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2321   WHEN "39" MOVE "Conflict Attribute       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2322   WHEN "41" MOVE "Already Open             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY920    04/04/2026  15:11:45:45                                  Page   44

  2323   WHEN "42" MOVE "Not Open                 " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2324   WHEN "43" MOVE "Read Not Done            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2325   WHEN "44" MOVE "Record Overflow          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2326   WHEN "46" MOVE "Read Error               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2327   WHEN "47" MOVE "Input Denied             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2328   WHEN "48" MOVE "Output Denied            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2329   WHEN "49" MOVE "I/O Denied               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2330   WHEN "51" MOVE "Record Locked            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2331   WHEN "52" MOVE "End-Of-Page              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2332   WHEN "57" MOVE "I/O Linage               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2333   WHEN "61" MOVE "File Sharing Failure     " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2334   WHEN "71" MOVE "Bad Character LS         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2335   WHEN "91" MOVE "Feature Not Available    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2336            WHEN OTHER
  2337   MOVE "Unknown File PY-PR1-Status      " TO WS-
  2338  *>
  2339       END-EVALUATE.
